$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=tm2hstep  LOC_AFTER=?

* One machine step as a Hoare triple: from the configurations at label ` A ` whose state-and-stacks part lies in ` P ` , the machine reaches in one step the configurations of ` D ` , provided the value of ` stepAux ` on the statement at ` A ` lies in ` D ` for every such part.  The only rule of the calculus that touches the machine model; the seven equation lemmas ~ tm2sahalt through ~ tm2sapop compute its hypothesis.  Lean: ` step_label ` with ` runsTo_succ ` .

